{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22820","headline":"醉後题李马二妓 · 白居易","name":"醉後题李马二妓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行摇云髻花钿节，应似霓裳趁管弦。\n艳动舞帬浑是火，愁凝歌黛欲生烟。\n有风纵道能回雪，无水何由忽吐莲。\n疑是两般心未决，雨中神女月中仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22820.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22820","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}